[statement]
In a package's dependencies, a name with a single candidate is not settled
before the others: `b` lists `x` first, `x` is decided first, for `p1`,
though `y`, provided by `p2` alone, then needs `p2` too. Contrast
`request/a-requested-name-with-one-candidate-is-settled-first`.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:x y
k:10

P:b
V:1
D:x y

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
install p2 1
install b 1
